<https://w3id.org/dcatr#> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "DCAT-R: Data Catalog Vocabulary for RDF Repositories" .
<https://w3id.org/dcatr#> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Extension of DCAT 3 for describing RDF repositories, datasets, and named graphs. DCAT-R introduces a four-level hierarchy (Service, Repository, Dataset, Graph) tailored for RDF infrastructure." .
<https://w3id.org/dcatr#> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> _:genid1 .
