<https://w3id.org/dcatr#serviceManifestGraph> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Service-specific configuration graph, local to this service instance." .
<https://w3id.org/dcatr#serviceManifestGraph> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/dcatr#> .
