<https://w3id.org/dcatr#Dataset> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/dcatr#Directory> .
<https://w3id.org/dcatr#Dataset> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Dataset" .
<https://w3id.org/dcatr#Dataset> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The RDF dataset within a repository, modeled as both a DCAT catalog and a DCATR Directory. As the root directory of the graph hierarchy, it contains data graphs and nested directories." .
<https://w3id.org/dcatr#Dataset> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/dcatr#> .
<https://w3id.org/dcatr#dataGraph> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<https://w3id.org/dcatr#dataGraph> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/dcatr#dataGraph> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <https://w3id.org/dcatr#member> .
<https://w3id.org/dcatr#dataGraph> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/dcatr#Dataset> .
<https://w3id.org/dcatr#dataGraph> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/dcatr#DataGraph> .
<https://w3id.org/dcatr#dataGraph> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "data graph" .
<https://w3id.org/dcatr#dataGraph> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a dataset to its constituent data graphs. Only DataGraphs (user data) belong to the Dataset; SystemGraphs are linked directly to the Repository." .
<https://w3id.org/dcatr#dataGraph> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/dcatr#> .
